  "details": "Attached is my initial VR Puppetry mock-up. As you can see the touch-pad is mapped to puppet eye movement.\n\nThis can be achieved with animation overrides, but with one major flaw- only one blend shape can be used at a time. The analogue \"FIST\" animation resets other hand animations like \"THUMBS UP\".\n\nThe ability to control more than one blend shape at a time would incredibly benefit the immersion and emotion of a VR puppet.",
